            "value" : "This matters only if your Photos library keeps its originals in iCloud. Then Mosaic Companion can download a sharp copy of the photographs it shows full screen, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %1$lld a day and %2$lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. With Nothing, Mosaic Companion tells you in its window if some close-ups turn out blurry. You can change this in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
